1
00:02:22,720 --> 00:02:23,560
Wang Yang.
王阳

2
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:26,560
Wang Yang.
王阳

3
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,280
Wang Yang.
王阳

4
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:51,680
Uncle.
叔

5
00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:53,680
I'm here for Wang Yang.
找王阳

6
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:55,840
Wang Yang's not home.
王阳不在家

7
00:02:55,920 --> 00:02:56,920
Then... then I'll get going, uncle.
那…那我先走了，叔

8
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:57,880
Hold on.
你等会

9
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:03,120
Where's Wang Yang been going these days? You know?
最近这些日子王阳都老去哪知道不？

10
00:03:03,200 --> 00:03:05,400
No idea. I haven't seen him in ages.
不知道啊，我挺长时间没瞅着他了

11
00:03:05,480 --> 00:03:06,640
Don't feed me a pack of lies.
少瞎话连篇的

12
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:10,040
You two are together all day, and you don't know where he goes?
你俩成天在一块，他去哪你不知道？

13
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:11,240
No, uncle, I really don't know.
不是，叔，我真不知道

14
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:13,040
I haven't seen him in days.
我这都好几天没瞅着他了

15
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:14,920
Your dad's Qu Zhifei, right?
你爸叫曲志飞，是吧？

16
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:18,200
Works in dispatch.
在调度上

17
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:21,040
Every time your dad sees me,
你爸见着我

18
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:23,920
it's "Wang-ge" this, "Master Wang" that, always first to say hello.
一口一个王哥 一口一个王师傅地主动打招呼

19
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,000
Did you know that?
你知道不？

20
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:29,880
Should I have your dad join the search?
让你爸一块找去啊？

21
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:30,880
No, don't. I...
别的啊，我…

22
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:53,080
Where are the two of them?
他俩呢？

23
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,200
Hey, I'm asking you a damn question.
不是，我他妈问你话呢

24
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,400
Where's Shen Mo?
沈墨呢？

25
00:04:11,600 --> 00:04:13,040
Did something happen to Shen Mo?
沈墨是不是出事了？

26
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:20,800
I don't know.
我不知道

27
00:04:21,960 --> 00:04:25,440
Jun-ge told me to give you this.
这个军哥让我给你的

28
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:36,840
Slow down, uncle.
叔，你慢点

29
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,200
Turn left up ahead.
前面左拐

30
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:46,680
We're here. This is it.
到了，就这

31
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:55,640
Uncle, I'm not going in.
叔，我不进去了

32
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:57,040
I've hardly ever been here.
我没怎么来过这

33
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,200
Keep up.
跟上

34
00:05:19,640 --> 00:05:20,680
Who are you looking for?
你找谁啊？

35
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,560
I'm looking for Wang Yang.
我找王阳

36
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,200
Dad.
爸

37
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:34,640
What are you doing here?
你在这干啥呢？

38
00:05:36,640 --> 00:05:37,560
Come home.
回家

39
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:39,960
You go on back, Dad.
你先回去吧，爸

40
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:41,480
I'll be home in a bit.
我等会就回去

41
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:42,840
Come home.
回家

42
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:45,280
Dad, I...
爸，我…

43
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:46,480
Come home.
回家

44
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:47,560
I...
我…

45
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:53,400
Don't recognize me anymore?
你不认识我了？

46
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:55,840
The police station.
公安局

47
00:05:56,400 --> 00:05:57,560
You tried to run,
你想跑

48
00:05:58,280 --> 00:05:59,680
and one trip from me laid you out flat.
被我一绊撂那了

49
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:00,840
Now listen to me.
我跟你说啊

50
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:02,400
You're not to see him again.
以后不许找他了

51
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:04,120
He's not like you people.
他跟你们不一样

52
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:06,720
Come home.
回家

53
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:08,160
-But Dad, I've still got things to do.
-Come...
-不是，爸，我还有事呢
-回…

54
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,360
-Come home.
-I...
-回家
-我…

55
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:11,120
-I said come home.
-I'm really not leaving.
-我让你回家
-我真不走

56
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:12,200
Qu Bo, give me a hand.
曲波，搭把手

57
00:06:12,760 --> 00:06:13,720
Wang Yang, whatever it is, say it at home.
王阳，你有啥回去说呀

58
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:15,520
-Wang Yang, talk at home.
-Get lost.
-王阳，回家说
-你给我滚

59
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:16,520
Talk at home.
回家说

60
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:18,280
-Who the hell asked you...
-What... what are you doing?
-让他妈你说…
-你…你干什么？

61
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:19,480
-Asked you to blab to my dad?
-Stop it.
-让你跟我爸说
-停

62
00:06:19,960 --> 00:06:21,000
-You just... you fucking...
-What...
-你就他妈你…
-干…

63
00:06:21,080 --> 00:06:23,320
-What are you doing?
-You and your damn big mouth.
-你干什么你？
-就他妈你话多

64
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:26,600
So you've learned to hit people now?
你还学会打人了你

65
00:06:27,320 --> 00:06:28,240
Who taught you that?
跟谁学的？

66
00:06:28,320 --> 00:06:29,400
Him?
跟他学的？

67
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:31,760
Come home.
回家

68
00:06:34,760 --> 00:06:35,880
Get up now, come on.
快起来，来

69
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,360
You could've really hurt him.
把人打坏了

70
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:40,520
Don't sink to his level.
别跟他一般见识啊

71
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:45,040
Come home.
回家

72
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:46,600
Come home.
回家

73
00:06:51,280 --> 00:06:52,480
I'll come home with you.
我跟你回家

74
00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:55,360
And you, listen to me.
我跟你说啊

75
00:06:55,840 --> 00:06:57,320
Stay away from him from now on.
以后别找他了

76
00:06:57,880 --> 00:06:59,400
You saw it all yourself.
你都看着了

77
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,680
The police bureau, the crime squad —
公安局、刑警队

78
00:07:00,760 --> 00:07:02,160
I know them all.
我们都是熟人

79
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:03,400
Don't go asking for trouble.
别找不自在

80
00:07:13,640 --> 00:07:14,640
Yang'er.
阳儿

81
00:07:15,880 --> 00:07:17,400
What happened to you?
你这是怎么的了？

82
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:20,520
Whatever's wrong, you can tell your mom.
你有啥事，你跟妈说呀你

83
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:21,880
I'm fine, Mom.
我没事，妈

84
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:23,000
Go to bed.
妳睡觉去吧

85
00:07:23,080 --> 00:07:24,040
I'm going to sleep too.
我也睡觉了

86
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:25,000
Yang'er.
阳儿

87
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:26,000
Stop right there.
你站住

88
00:07:27,840 --> 00:07:30,120
What exactly is going on between you and that man from the video hall?
你跟录像厅那个人到底怎么回事？

89
00:07:31,520 --> 00:07:32,720
Nothing's going on.
啥事也没有

90
00:07:33,200 --> 00:07:34,320
I'm going to sleep.
我要睡觉

91
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:35,240
Yang'er.
阳儿

92
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:36,720
Wait, Yang'er.
不是，阳儿

93
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:38,800
Yang'er, don't rush off to bed.
阳儿，你别急着睡觉

94
00:07:38,880 --> 00:07:41,240
Quit wailing my name. Stop pushing me, all right?
妳别叫魂了，别再逼我了，行吗？

95
00:07:41,320 --> 00:07:42,800
Is that how you talk to your mom?
怎么跟你妈说话呢？

96
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:45,760
Talk to her like that again and I'll break your damn legs.
再他妈这么跟你妈说话，我打折你腿

97
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:48,200
What is going on with you two?
这都怎么的了这是？

98
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:53,600
You... you go back to the room first.
妳…妳先回屋

99
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:54,720
I'll tell you if anything comes up.
有事我跟妳說

100
00:07:55,440 --> 00:07:57,560
Don't lose your temper with him. Talk to him gently.
你别跟他发脾气，要好好说他

101
00:07:58,160 --> 00:07:59,000
Go on.
去

102
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:10,440
You know how your mom's health is.
你妈这个身体你知道

103
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:13,200
Don't make her worry.
别让她担心

104
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:16,080
Let's talk this out, father to son.
咱爷俩好好说话

105
00:08:18,080 --> 00:08:19,480
These past few days —
就这些日子

106
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:21,400
what have you been up to?
你都干啥去了？

107
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:26,880
Nothing.
我没干啥

108
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:42,480
Then what's this?
怎么回事？

109
00:08:46,640 --> 00:08:48,920
What kind of mountain climbing draws blood?
爬什么山能爬出血来？

110
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:54,240
Son, did you kill someone?
儿子，你是不是杀人了？

111
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:11,280
Son.
儿子

112
00:09:12,599 --> 00:09:14,040
I'm your father.
我是你爹

113
00:09:15,880 --> 00:09:19,040
Whatever happens to me, I won't let anything happen to you.
就是我出啥事也不能让你出事

114
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:23,760
But you have to tell me the truth first.
但是前提是你得跟我说实话

115
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:25,240
You can't keep things from me.
你不能瞒着我

116
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:27,040
Whatever it is, we'll deal with it together.
有什么事，咱们解决什么事

117
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:29,280
This is the last chance for you and me.
这是咱爷俩最后的机会了

118
00:09:30,880 --> 00:09:33,840
Turning yourself in is nothing like the police coming to arrest you.
你自首跟公安局抓你性质完全不一样

119
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:35,720
Don't do anything stupid, son.
你不能犯傻，儿子

120
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:39,440
Dad.
爸

121
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,320
Just give me two more days.
你再给我两天时间

122
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:47,560
What do you need two days for?
你要两天时间干啥？

123
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:50,200
There's still something
我还有点事

124
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:52,160
I absolutely have to go do.
我必须得去办

125
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:55,120
Until you explain yourself, you're not going anywhere.
你不跟我说清楚，哪都不能去

126
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:57,600
Dad.
爸

127
00:09:58,520 --> 00:09:59,680
I have to go.
我必须得去

128
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:07,120
What... what did you stuff into your pocket back at the video hall?
你…你在录像厅里 往兜里揣的什么东西？

129
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:09,120
Take it out...
拿出来…

130
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:18,880
Who wrote this?
谁写的？

131
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:22,120
Where are you going on the 17th?
17号要去哪？

132
00:10:25,680 --> 00:10:26,680
Dad.
爸

133
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:30,480
One day I'll explain everything, I promise.
我以后一定给你解释清楚

134
00:10:32,800 --> 00:10:34,680
But right now I really can't say.
但是我现在真不能说

135
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:46,320
Meisu...
美素…

136
00:10:46,400 --> 00:10:47,520
-Dad.
-The rope.
-爸
-绳子

137
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:50,440
-Mom.
-Put this away.
-妈
-这收着

138
00:10:50,520 --> 00:10:51,640
Mom, don't...
妈，妳别…

139
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:53,440
Son, just... just bear with it.
儿子，你…你挺一挺啊

140
00:10:53,520 --> 00:10:55,040
-It's all for your own good.
-Dad.
-我们都是为你好
-爸

141
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:56,480
Don't struggle, son.
你别挣扎，儿子

142
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:58,120
-Don't struggle. Hold still.
-Dad. Mom.
-别挣扎，别动
-爸、妈

143
00:10:58,200 --> 00:10:59,960
It's for your own good, child.
我们都是为你好，孩子

144
00:11:00,040 --> 00:11:01,240
Whatever you do, don't...
你千万别…

145
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:06,400
Those rotten things.
坏东西

146
00:11:15,280 --> 00:11:16,240
If he says he didn't kill anyone,
他要说没杀人

147
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:17,440
then he didn't.
那肯定没杀

148
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:20,680
Our son wouldn't dare kill so much as a chicken.
咱这儿子连个鸡都不敢杀

149
00:11:20,760 --> 00:11:22,440
The two of us believe him.
咱俩相信他

150
00:11:22,920 --> 00:11:24,400
But will the police?
公安局相信吗？

151
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:26,200
Will Ma Desheng?
马德胜相信吗？

152
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:33,120
Listen to me.
我跟你说

153
00:11:34,400 --> 00:11:35,840
Hasn't he been mixing with bad friends?
他是不是交啥坏朋友了？

154
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:39,520
He must have been tricked.
他肯定被人骗了

155
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:41,360
It must be that bunch who did it.
肯定是这帮人干的

156
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,360
Go find Ma Desheng.
你去找马德胜

157
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:43,600
Tell him
你就跟他说

158
00:11:43,680 --> 00:11:44,920
to hurry up and arrest those people.
赶紧去抓这帮人

159
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,160
Then our son will be safe.
这样咱儿子就安全

160
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:47,680
Tell him our son had nothing to do with it.
你就跟他说咱儿子没关系

161
00:11:47,760 --> 00:11:49,120
-He must have been tricked.
-All right...
-一定是被骗的
-好…

162
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:50,920
-Tell him that and we'll be fine.
-Enough.
-你跟他说，咱就没事了啊
-不说了

163
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:53,000
Enough...
不说了…

164
00:11:57,560 --> 00:11:58,800
What do we do?
怎么办啊？

165
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,280
As for us —
咱俩呢

166
00:12:05,560 --> 00:12:07,280
we keep the boy locked up for now.
把孩子先关起来

167
00:12:08,680 --> 00:12:10,200
Right under our noses —
在眼皮子底下

168
00:12:10,880 --> 00:12:12,000
that's safest.
最安全

169
00:12:13,560 --> 00:12:14,480
Then
完了

170
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:17,000
I'll get to the bottom of this,
我肯定把这事整明白

171
00:12:17,760 --> 00:12:19,200
and our son will be in the clear.
咱儿子就没事了

172
00:13:24,720 --> 00:13:29,080
(Take the Hualin freight line on the night of the 17th)
（17日晚走桦运专线）

173
00:13:48,040 --> 00:13:50,000
Listen. You hear all that?
你听听这都是啥动静

174
00:13:52,160 --> 00:13:53,360
Hear what?
什么动静啊？

175
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:59,160
That's the sound of money,
这都是钱的动静

176
00:13:59,240 --> 00:14:01,760
gushing straight into your pocket, Mr. Lu.
哗哗地都流你卢总口袋里了

177
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:05,200
You're quite the joker, Director Song.
宋厂长真会说笑啊

178
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:08,520
I've signed off on that bank draft, you know.
那汇票我可签完字了

179
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:11,480
It'll hit your account right on the 17th.
17号准时到你帐上

180
00:14:12,120 --> 00:14:14,240
Wenzhong here knows exactly what he owes you.
文仲心里有数的

181
00:14:14,320 --> 00:14:16,040
Without you, where would I be?
没有你，哪有我啊？

182
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:17,960
However deep my pockets get,
就算我口袋再大

183
00:14:18,040 --> 00:14:21,240
they're still just your checking account, aren't they, Director Song?
还不是宋厂长您的活期存折的吗？

184
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:24,440
Watch your wording.
注意你的措辞啊

185
00:14:24,520 --> 00:14:26,680
Building up Hualin Steel is a duty we both share.
建设桦钢，你我有责啊

186
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:31,320
Tonight, at the Victoria.
晚上，维多利亚

187
00:14:31,400 --> 00:14:32,920
Let's have a few extra rounds.
我们多喝两杯

188
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:07,720
So you're saying it was a misunderstanding?
你是说是误会是吧？

189
00:15:07,800 --> 00:15:09,240
Yes, a misunderstanding.
对，是误会

190
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:11,720
Where was your son Wang Yang caught?
你儿子王阳跟哪被逮着的？

191
00:15:14,280 --> 00:15:16,000
The finance office, wasn't it?
是不是财务室？

192
00:15:17,960 --> 00:15:18,800
Yes.
是

193
00:15:18,880 --> 00:15:20,680
And what does Xing Jianchun do?
邢建春是干啥的？

194
00:15:20,760 --> 00:15:22,240
Isn't he chief of the security section?
是不是保卫科的科长？

195
00:15:23,600 --> 00:15:25,040
So when he catches your son,
那他逮你儿子

196
00:15:25,720 --> 00:15:27,160
how exactly is that a misunderstanding?
这怎么叫误会呢？

197
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:31,600
No, Director, here's the thing.
不是，厂长，是这样

198
00:15:32,160 --> 00:15:35,840
Xing Jianchun lured my son to the finance office.
邢建春把我儿子引诱到了财务室

199
00:15:36,560 --> 00:15:38,080
He's abusing his post to settle a private score.
他这是公报私仇

200
00:15:38,160 --> 00:15:40,640
You have a private feud with Xing Jianchun?
你跟邢建春有私仇啊？

201
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:43,280
Well, not a feud exactly.
要说私仇也不算是私仇

202
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:45,040
He was reselling factory property,
他倒卖公家的财物

203
00:15:45,120 --> 00:15:46,160
and I caught him.
我给逮着了

204
00:15:46,720 --> 00:15:47,880
From a certain lofty standpoint,
从一定高度上讲呢

205
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:49,520
I was ridding the people of a menace.
我这是为民除害

206
00:15:51,280 --> 00:15:52,240
Master Wang.
王师傅啊

207
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:54,160
If Xing Jianchun really has that problem,
邢建春要真有这个问题

208
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:55,880
I'll chase it down whether you report it or not.
你不说，我也会追查到底

209
00:15:57,400 --> 00:15:59,400
But that's not what we're discussing.
但咱现在说的不是这事

210
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:01,640
We're discussing your son, Wang Yang.
咱现在说的是你儿子王阳

211
00:16:01,720 --> 00:16:05,920
Security's finding is that he intended to steal from the finance office.
保卫科给的意见是 有盗窃财务室的意图

212
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:08,400
And what is Hualin Steel?
桦钢是啥呀？

213
00:16:08,480 --> 00:16:09,960
Hualin Steel is the face of Hualin.
桦钢是桦林的门面

214
00:16:10,040 --> 00:16:12,360
There's no room in it for people who flirt with crime.
容不下游走在犯罪边缘的人

215
00:16:13,280 --> 00:16:14,320
That's the whole of it.
事就这么个事

216
00:16:14,400 --> 00:16:15,320
I've made myself clear.
我说清楚了

217
00:16:15,400 --> 00:16:16,760
I have a meeting. You can go.
我还有个会，你先回去吧

218
00:16:24,880 --> 00:16:25,800
Director.
厂长

219
00:16:31,400 --> 00:16:32,320
Director.
厂长

220
00:16:33,240 --> 00:16:35,200
There's one more thing I'd like to clear up.
有个事我还想跟你解释一下

221
00:16:35,280 --> 00:16:36,440
Go ahead.
你说

222
00:16:38,160 --> 00:16:39,840
About that night —
就是那天晚上

223
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:43,800
I really didn't see anything.
我真的没瞅见啥

224
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:51,240
What are you trying to say?
你想说啥呀？

225
00:16:52,520 --> 00:16:54,800
The day I delivered the liquor,
就是我送酒那天

226
00:16:54,880 --> 00:16:59,560
I... I did hear that... that slapping sound.
我…我确实我听见了那个 啪啪啪那个动静了

227
00:16:59,640 --> 00:17:00,520
But...
但是…

228
00:17:01,560 --> 00:17:04,200
I honestly never saw who it was.
人是谁我真的没瞅见

229
00:17:06,120 --> 00:17:07,840
And anyway, that's one matter and this is another.
完了一码是一码

230
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:09,000
I figured...
我寻思…

231
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:11,400
if we talked it out in the open,
咱把这事说开了

232
00:17:11,480 --> 00:17:13,200
it wouldn't have to affect my son joining the factory.
别影响我儿子进厂

233
00:17:23,520 --> 00:17:24,840
So you're holding this over me, are you?
在这事拿我是吧？

234
00:17:26,360 --> 00:17:27,640
Plain blackmail.
就是要挟我

235
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:30,040
If I let your son into the factory,
我要让你儿子进厂

236
00:17:30,120 --> 00:17:31,640
you saw nothing.
你就啥也没瞅见

237
00:17:31,720 --> 00:17:32,960
If I don't let Wang Yang in,
我不让王阳进厂

238
00:17:33,520 --> 00:17:36,000
you figure you can use it to smear me whenever you like.
你就寻思用这事随时能把我搞臭

239
00:17:36,080 --> 00:17:37,040
That's the play, isn't it?
是这路子不？

240
00:17:37,119 --> 00:17:38,760
No, Director.
不是，厂长

241
00:17:38,840 --> 00:17:40,080
I...
我…

242
00:17:40,159 --> 00:17:42,320
Master Wang, this conversation is over.
王师傅，今儿谈话就到这了

243
00:17:43,119 --> 00:17:44,960
-No, Director, you have to let me finish...
-Get out.
-不是，厂长，你得让我把话说…
-滚

244
00:17:45,440 --> 00:17:46,320
Get out.
滚

245
00:17:55,320 --> 00:17:57,399
Never mind "get out." You're going to let me finish.
滚不滚的，你让我把话说完

246
00:17:58,760 --> 00:17:59,720
Talk.
说

247
00:18:03,600 --> 00:18:04,840
My father
我爸啊

248
00:18:06,240 --> 00:18:07,880
was one of Hualin Steel's founding veterans.
是桦钢的元老

249
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:12,760
I've been a model worker at the locomotive depot year after year.
我是机务段年年的先进

250
00:18:14,080 --> 00:18:15,760
And now, in my son's generation,
到我儿子这辈

251
00:18:16,360 --> 00:18:19,160
I won't stand for crooks framing him either.
我也不容坏人栽赃陷害他

252
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:23,600
If someone here is playing dirty tricks,
如果有人在这搞这些歪门邪道

253
00:18:23,680 --> 00:18:25,080
wrecking the factory and framing people,
破坏厂子，诬陷人

254
00:18:25,160 --> 00:18:27,760
then who ends up getting the hell out is anyone's guess.
最后滚的指不定他妈是谁呢

255
00:18:38,760 --> 00:18:39,840
Moral corruption! Sleeping around!
道德败坏，搞破鞋

256
00:18:39,920 --> 00:18:41,160
And you think you're in the right?
你还有理了你？

257
00:18:41,720 --> 00:18:42,880
I'll report you!
告你去我

258
00:18:43,600 --> 00:18:45,400
To the union, the Women's Federation,
我上工会、上妇联

259
00:18:45,480 --> 00:18:47,680
the newspapers, the radio, the TV station!
上报社、电台、电视台

260
00:18:47,760 --> 00:18:48,880
I'll damn well...
我他妈…

261
00:18:50,360 --> 00:18:51,680
Brother-in-law, what are you fussing with?
姐夫，捣鼓啥呢？

262
00:18:51,760 --> 00:18:53,160
N-nothing.
没…没事

263
00:18:53,240 --> 00:18:55,160
And you... what are you doing over here?
那个妳…妳过来干啥？

264
00:18:55,240 --> 00:18:58,040
I... I'm just meeting a friend.
我…我只是找个朋友

265
00:18:59,360 --> 00:19:00,480
-Right, well...
-Right.
-行，那…
-行

266
00:19:00,560 --> 00:19:02,360
-All good?
-All... all good...
-没啥事？
-没…没事…

267
00:19:43,880 --> 00:19:45,360
What's all that waving about?
你比划啥呢？

268
00:19:48,440 --> 00:19:50,480
I just hauled up two crates of beer.
我刚搬两箱啤酒

269
00:19:50,560 --> 00:19:51,960
My hands are a little sore, bro.
手有点酸，哥

270
00:19:52,040 --> 00:19:52,960
Just shaking them out.
晃悠晃悠

271
00:19:53,520 --> 00:19:54,760
I'll get back to work, bro.
忙去了啊，哥

272
00:20:11,040 --> 00:20:12,920
Nobody leaves a drop tonight, got it?
咱们谁都别剩酒，知道吗？

273
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:15,440
-Of course.
-Come on... bottoms up.
-那必须的
-来…干

274
00:20:15,520 --> 00:20:19,680
-Fly, fly...
-Fly, fly...
-飞呀…
-飞呀…

275
00:20:19,760 --> 00:20:21,080
You sure can drink, bro.
好酒量，哥

276
00:20:21,160 --> 00:20:22,320
Come on, pour me another.
来，给哥倒酒

277
00:20:22,400 --> 00:20:23,320
Okay.
好

278
00:20:23,920 --> 00:20:26,080
-Fly, fly...
-Fly, fly...
-飞呀…
-飞呀…

279
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:28,040
What're you doing?
干啥呢？

280
00:20:28,120 --> 00:20:29,080
Nothing.
没有

281
00:20:29,160 --> 00:20:30,160
-Spitting out your drink?
-No.
-吐酒呢？
-没有

282
00:20:30,240 --> 00:20:32,280
-Bro, I drained every drop.
-You...
-哥，我都干了呀都
-妳…

283
00:20:36,960 --> 00:20:38,040
Then what's this stuff?
这什么玩意？

284
00:20:38,800 --> 00:20:40,520
Little sis, you playing me?
老妹，妳糊弄我呢？

285
00:20:40,600 --> 00:20:41,560
No...
没…

286
00:20:42,200 --> 00:20:44,560
-One... one more glass...
-Bro, come on... I'll have another...
-再…再来一杯…
-哥，来…我再来一杯…

287
00:20:44,640 --> 00:20:46,160
-Put that drink down.
-You've got one too?
-妳给我放下酒啊
-妳也有啊？

288
00:20:46,240 --> 00:20:48,400
-I wasn't... I wasn't dodging the drink.
-Stop singing...
-没放…没想赖酒
-别唱了…

289
00:20:48,480 --> 00:20:49,800
I'm not one to dodge a drink.
不是赖酒的人

290
00:20:49,880 --> 00:20:50,960
Little sis.
老妹

291
00:20:51,520 --> 00:20:53,440
You think I've had too much, don't you?
妳是不是觉得我喝多了？

292
00:20:54,680 --> 00:20:56,160
-Have I had too much?
-No, bro.
-我喝多了吗？
-没有，哥

293
00:20:56,240 --> 00:20:57,320
Have I?
我喝多了吗？

294
00:20:57,400 --> 00:20:59,520
Course not, bro. Not at all.
哪能呀？ 哥，没有

295
00:20:59,600 --> 00:21:03,240
-Bro, why come here if not to drink?
-Here, drink a little more.
-哥，不喝多来这干啥呀？
-来，再喝一点

296
00:21:03,320 --> 00:21:04,160
Bottoms up.
我干了

297
00:21:10,800 --> 00:21:11,960
That's it? You're quitting?
妳这就拉倒了？

298
00:21:12,040 --> 00:21:12,960
Not quitting, bro.
不拉倒，哥

299
00:21:13,040 --> 00:21:14,080
You tell me — how many?
你说陪几个

300
00:21:15,920 --> 00:21:16,760
Three.
喝仨

301
00:21:16,840 --> 00:21:18,280
-Three it is.
-Top them up.
-来三个
-再添点吧

302
00:21:18,360 --> 00:21:19,680
-Top them up.
-Forget three.
-再添点
-不用仨

303
00:21:19,760 --> 00:21:21,280
I'll chug this whole bottle.
这一瓶我吹了

304
00:21:22,560 --> 00:21:23,920
Now that's a tolerance.
这酒量可以呀

305
00:21:28,440 --> 00:21:30,160
-Impressive.
-That's right.
-真行
-对嘛

306
00:21:30,240 --> 00:21:32,560
-Now that's drinking!
-Have another...
-这才是喝酒嘛
-喝一个…

307
00:21:32,640 --> 00:21:35,440
-It's a drink, not medicine, right?
-Are you... are you okay?
-喝个酒又不是让妳喝药，对不？
-妳没…没事吧？

308
00:21:35,520 --> 00:21:36,760
-Come on... cheers.
-Come on...
-来…干
-来…

309
00:21:36,840 --> 00:21:38,960
-Come on...
-Come on... cheers.
-来…
-来…干杯

310
00:21:39,040 --> 00:21:40,600
-Arms linked for this one.
-Absolutely.
-喝个交杯
-必须的

311
00:21:40,680 --> 00:21:42,080
-She can really drink.
-Go easy.
-挺能喝呀
-妳少喝点

312
00:21:42,160 --> 00:21:43,760
-Two little bees, flying through the flowers.
-Come on.
-两只小蜜蜂呀，飞到花丛中呀
-来

313
00:21:43,840 --> 00:21:44,840
-Pour me another.
-Fly, fly...
-给哥倒酒
-飞呀…

314
00:21:44,920 --> 00:21:46,480
-I'm fine.
-Fly, fly...
-没事
-飞呀…

315
00:21:46,560 --> 00:21:47,880
-Keep drinking.
-Fly, fly...
-接着喝
-飞呀…

316
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:49,040
-Keep singing.
-Fly, fly...
-接着唱
-飞呀…

317
00:21:53,000 --> 00:21:55,080
Well then, Director Song, see you tomorrow.
那宋厂长，我们明天见啦

318
00:21:55,160 --> 00:21:56,160
See you tomorrow.
明天见

319
00:21:56,800 --> 00:21:57,680
Head on back.
回吧

320
00:21:57,760 --> 00:21:59,200
Drive safe. Take it slow.
注意安全，慢慢开

321
00:21:59,280 --> 00:22:00,120
All right.
好

322
00:22:22,600 --> 00:22:24,400
Bring... bring them up on the stage.
拿…拿台上来

323
00:22:25,320 --> 00:22:27,080
Stack them next to the piano.
给我码在钢琴边上啊

324
00:22:27,160 --> 00:22:28,880
Come on, further in. Line them up in a row.
来，往里摆，摆成一排啊

325
00:22:28,960 --> 00:22:30,320
All the way around the piano.
围绕这钢琴边上

326
00:22:34,360 --> 00:22:35,600
Earning a little extra, huh?
挣外快了啊

327
00:22:35,680 --> 00:22:36,800
From Mr. Lu.
卢总送的

328
00:22:37,400 --> 00:22:38,760
A hundred apiece.
一个100

329
00:22:38,840 --> 00:22:40,360
Whoever they're addressed to gets 50.
指名送谁，谁得50

330
00:22:40,440 --> 00:22:42,200
That batch is 300 for you.
妳这把300

331
00:22:42,880 --> 00:22:44,120
Which one is Mr. Lu?
谁是卢总？

332
00:22:46,040 --> 00:22:48,080
Over there — the slicked-back hair.
看那个，那小背头

333
00:22:50,880 --> 00:22:52,440
Go thank the man.
谢谢人家呀

334
00:23:02,440 --> 00:23:03,280
That's it?
完了？

335
00:23:03,920 --> 00:23:05,400
How else should I thank him?
那不然怎么谢？

336
00:23:06,240 --> 00:23:07,680
He's spending real, hard cash here.
那人家真金白银花着的

337
00:23:07,760 --> 00:23:08,800
He obviously likes you.
肯定是喜欢妳呀

338
00:23:08,880 --> 00:23:09,880
You...
妳…

339
00:23:09,960 --> 00:23:11,120
Show a little appreciation.
表示表示啊

340
00:23:13,960 --> 00:23:16,160
Then could I trouble you to return them to him?
那要不麻烦你帮我退给他吧？

341
00:23:16,840 --> 00:23:18,360
I can't take his things for nothing.
我不能白要人家东西

342
00:23:18,440 --> 00:23:20,080
What's all this "return, return, return"?
啥玩意就退退退的

343
00:23:20,160 --> 00:23:21,680
Is this a cabbage stand? Returns, just like that?
买白菜呢？ 说退就退了

344
00:23:22,760 --> 00:23:25,280
If you want them returned, tell him yourself, face to face, after your shift.
妳要退，妳下班以后 妳当面跟他说去

345
00:23:25,840 --> 00:23:28,200
After work I have to get back to school. There's no time.
我下班还要回学校，没时间

346
00:23:28,280 --> 00:23:29,880
What's the rush getting back to school?
回学校着什么急？

347
00:23:36,320 --> 00:23:38,640
Mr. Lu is one of the Victoria's biggest clients.
这卢总是咱维多利亚大客户

348
00:23:38,720 --> 00:23:41,040
He just wants to chat with you a while.
人家就想跟妳唠会嗑

349
00:23:41,120 --> 00:23:43,200
And then, when all that talking dries out your throat,
然后完了，那个嗓子唠干巴了

350
00:23:43,280 --> 00:23:45,360
he'll get you a little beer to wet it, that's all.
说就给妳整点小啤酒润润啥的

351
00:23:45,440 --> 00:23:47,320
Your big bro just doesn't want you going thirsty.
哥不是怕妳渴嘛

352
00:23:48,160 --> 00:23:49,280
I don't drink with clients.
我不陪酒

353
00:23:50,280 --> 00:23:52,080
Now how is that "drinking with clients"?
这怎么能叫陪酒呢？

354
00:23:53,840 --> 00:23:54,960
Do your big bro a favor here.
妳帮哥个忙

355
00:23:55,040 --> 00:23:56,360
Give me a little face, won't you?
给我个面子，行不？

356
00:23:56,440 --> 00:23:58,640
If it really puts you in a spot, I can quit.
那你要是实在为难，我可以辞职

357
00:23:58,720 --> 00:24:00,640
You... you stubborn kid, you...
妳这…妳这孩子，妳…

358
00:24:01,280 --> 00:24:02,400
No... no need for that...
不…不至于…

359
00:24:02,880 --> 00:24:04,480
The man didn't even say anything, you...
人家没说啥，妳…

360
00:24:07,160 --> 00:24:08,320
Fine, just play your piano then.
那妳弹吧

361
00:24:16,760 --> 00:24:17,880
For you.
送你的

362
00:24:40,040 --> 00:24:42,040
Hold on...
等一下…

363
00:24:44,080 --> 00:24:45,160
Thank you.
谢谢

364
00:25:15,800 --> 00:25:17,040
Maybe you'd better get out.
要不妳下去吧？

365
00:25:17,600 --> 00:25:18,800
She'll be puking in my car any second.
吐我车上一会

366
00:25:29,280 --> 00:25:30,480
I'll help you down.
我扶妳下去

367
00:25:30,560 --> 00:25:31,520
Easy.
慢点

368
00:25:36,240 --> 00:25:37,120
Easy now.
慢点

369
00:25:45,080 --> 00:25:46,160
Are you okay?
没事吧？

370
00:25:54,480 --> 00:25:57,040
Well, if it isn't the piano-playing college girl.
这不弹钢琴的大学生吗？

371
00:26:03,480 --> 00:26:04,560
Drink less from now on.
以后少喝点

372
00:26:04,640 --> 00:26:06,160
It's bad for your health.
这样对身体不好

373
00:26:11,480 --> 00:26:14,080
Who doesn't know drinking is bad for you?
谁不知道喝多了对身体不好？

374
00:26:21,080 --> 00:26:23,040
If I don't drink, who pays me?
我不喝，谁给我钱啊？

375
00:26:26,760 --> 00:26:27,880
You?
妳给我？

376
00:26:31,240 --> 00:26:36,040
(Dynasty Video Hall)
（皇朝录像厅）

377
00:26:46,320 --> 00:26:47,480
Are you all right?
妳没事吧？

378
00:26:51,160 --> 00:26:52,960
Where... where is this?
这…这是哪啊？

379
00:26:53,040 --> 00:26:55,160
This is my little brother's video hall.
这是我弟的录像厅

380
00:26:58,760 --> 00:26:59,800
I'm fine.
我没啥事

381
00:27:00,280 --> 00:27:01,280
I'm heading home.
我回了

382
00:27:05,040 --> 00:27:07,000
Just sleep here tonight.
妳今天晚上就睡这吧

383
00:27:07,080 --> 00:27:08,960
Leave tomorrow, once you're feeling better.
明天好一点再走

384
00:27:18,280 --> 00:27:20,080
This is my little brother, Fu Weijun.
这是我弟，傅卫军

385
00:27:20,920 --> 00:27:22,080
I was afraid your stomach would hurt when you woke up,
我怕妳起来胃疼

386
