00:45:25,720 --> 00:45:29,400
nothing in this letter of accusation is true?
这封举报信上说的都不是事实？

586
00:45:36,240 --> 00:45:38,320
Then explain these photos.
这些照片妳解释一下

587
00:45:39,360 --> 00:45:41,400
Is this you or not?
这上面的是不是妳？

588
00:45:51,240 --> 00:45:52,200
Can I take the photos...
我能把照片拿走…

589
00:45:52,280 --> 00:45:54,040
Until this matter is cleared up,
在问题没有搞清楚之前

590
00:45:54,120 --> 00:45:55,840
the photos stay here with me.
这照片先放我这保管

591
00:45:55,920 --> 00:45:58,960
Don't worry. No one else will see them.
妳放心，不会再有其他人看到的

592
00:46:01,520 --> 00:46:03,040
And what counts as "cleared up"?
怎么算搞清楚？

593
00:46:05,760 --> 00:46:06,640
Shen Mo.
沈墨

594
00:46:07,600 --> 00:46:09,760
First, you need to trust us completely.
妳首先得完全信任我们

595
00:46:10,560 --> 00:46:12,440
If you keep refusing to cooperate,
妳要是一直这么不配合

596
00:46:12,520 --> 00:46:14,600
the consequences could be very serious.
后果可能非常地严重

597
00:46:22,600 --> 00:46:23,520
Shen Mo.
沈墨

598
00:46:29,440 --> 00:46:30,640
Shen Mo.
沈墨

599
00:46:32,680 --> 00:46:33,640
Shen Mo.
沈墨

600
00:46:34,600 --> 00:46:36,320
So what's the story with the photos and that letter?
那照片和信是怎么回事？

601
00:46:36,400 --> 00:46:37,920
Is there nothing you want to tell me?
妳就没啥想跟我说的吗？

602
00:46:38,400 --> 00:46:40,440
Didn't Qu Bo already tell you everything?
曲波不是都跟你说过了吗？

603
00:46:41,280 --> 00:46:42,920
There's nothing I want to say right now.
我现在没什么想说的

604
00:46:43,000 --> 00:46:44,240
Just go home.
你先回家吧

605
00:46:45,320 --> 00:46:47,120
What are you staring at? Go home and stare at your mom.
看什么看呀？ 回家看你妈去

606
00:46:47,200 --> 00:46:48,400
What's wrong with you?
有病吧你？

607
00:46:49,760 --> 00:46:50,840
Fine — you don't have to talk.
妳不想说也行

608
00:46:50,920 --> 00:46:52,240
What's past is past.
这事过去也就过去了

609
00:46:52,320 --> 00:46:53,720
I can put it out of my mind.
我可以不往心里去

610
00:46:53,800 --> 00:46:55,520
But next time you're short of money, can't you just tell me?
但妳以后缺钱了，能不能跟我说呀？

611
00:46:55,600 --> 00:46:56,680
I can earn money, you know.
我可以挣啊

612
00:46:57,160 --> 00:46:58,400
Whatever you want to buy, whatever you want to do,
妳想买什么、想干什么

613
00:46:58,480 --> 00:46:59,680
you can tell me.
妳都可以告诉我

614
00:46:59,760 --> 00:47:01,560
Just stop taking up with those shady people out there.
妳别在外面认识那些乱七八糟的人

615
00:47:01,640 --> 00:47:03,480
Don't let them think you're easy to push around.
别让他们觉得妳好欺负

616
00:47:07,880 --> 00:47:09,720
So you think I'm that kind of person too?
你也觉得我是那样的人？

617
00:47:11,320 --> 00:47:12,160
That's not what I meant.
我不是那意思

618
00:47:12,240 --> 00:47:13,840
I know exactly what you meant.
我知道你什么意思

619
00:47:16,040 --> 00:47:17,320
Whether I did it willingly
不管我是自愿的

620
00:47:17,400 --> 00:47:18,960
or was forced into it,
还是被迫的

621
00:47:19,040 --> 00:47:21,160
I still need to earn your forgiveness. Is that it?
我还需要取得你的原谅是吗？

622
00:47:23,800 --> 00:47:25,400
I told you a long time ago.
我早就跟你说过了

623
00:47:27,520 --> 00:47:29,080
I'm not worth your love.
我不值得你喜欢

624
00:47:29,600 --> 00:47:31,000
I don't deserve to be with you.
我没有资格和你在一起

625
00:47:31,080 --> 00:47:31,960
Do you understand me?
你听明白了吗？

626
00:47:32,040 --> 00:47:34,280
If you finally understand, then go home.
这回你听明白了，你就回去

627
00:47:34,360 --> 00:47:36,280
Let's never see each other again.
我们以后都不要再见面了

628
00:47:43,680 --> 00:47:45,440
Completely naked, they say,
真啥也没穿

629
00:47:45,520 --> 00:47:47,040
just lying there on the bed.
就那么躺床上

630
00:47:47,120 --> 00:47:48,400
Seriously?
真假的呀？

631
00:47:48,920 --> 00:47:51,160
They say she's an escort at some KTV.
说是在KTV当三陪吧

632
00:47:55,800 --> 00:47:57,280
I'm going to eat. You two coming?
我吃饭去，妳们去不去？

633
00:47:57,360 --> 00:47:58,440
-Sure, I'm in.
-Let's go.
-走，我也去
-走

634
00:48:53,680 --> 00:48:54,840
What are you doing here?
妳怎么来了？

635
00:48:56,720 --> 00:48:58,560
Come on. Dinner's on me.
走啊，请妳吃饭

636
00:49:00,240 --> 00:49:02,840
(Yuanyuan Home-Style Restaurant)
（源媛家常菜馆）

637
00:49:08,680 --> 00:49:10,160
Go easy on that.
妳少喝点

638
00:49:10,240 --> 00:49:11,440
You've still got work later.
待会还上班呢

639
00:49:11,520 --> 00:49:14,160
I'll just go stick a finger down my throat after.
我待会去厕所抠嗓子就好了

640
00:49:14,640 --> 00:49:17,000
More than enough to handle those bastards.
对付那些王八蛋，绰绰有余

641
00:49:17,840 --> 00:49:19,880
That's terrible for your stomach.
这样对胃不好

642
00:49:20,360 --> 00:49:21,760
Don't trade your life for money.
别要钱不要命

643
00:49:21,840 --> 00:49:23,680
Without money, what's a life even for?
没有钱，要命有啥用？

644
00:49:33,440 --> 00:49:37,520
Why does it have to be the Victoria?
妳干嘛非得在维多利亚挣钱啊？

645
00:49:37,600 --> 00:49:39,240
Isn't there any other way to earn?
没有别的办法了吗？

646
00:49:53,400 --> 00:49:54,480
Earn how?
怎么挣啊？

647
00:49:55,240 --> 00:49:56,440
Playing the piano?
弹钢琴啊？

648
00:49:59,160 --> 00:50:01,080
That's not what I meant.
我不是这个意思

649
00:50:01,160 --> 00:50:02,520
Don't take it the wrong way.
妳别误会啊

650
00:50:04,000 --> 00:50:05,360
Look at you.
看妳

651
00:50:05,440 --> 00:50:07,240
What are you so nervous about?
瞎紧张什么呀？

652
00:50:07,320 --> 00:50:08,200
It's fine.
没事

653
00:50:08,280 --> 00:50:09,720
How I got to be what I am —
我自己什么变的

654
00:50:09,800 --> 00:50:10,920
nobody knows better than me.
我自己最清楚

655
00:50:12,560 --> 00:50:13,920
I've done odd jobs before.
我之前打过零工

656
00:50:14,000 --> 00:50:16,120
I washed people's feet in a massage parlor.
在按摩店给人洗过脚

657
00:50:16,200 --> 00:50:19,200
The Victoria is the easiest work I've ever had.
维多利亚干的活是最轻松的活

658
00:50:21,400 --> 00:50:22,360
Fried starch jelly.
煎粉

659
00:50:25,880 --> 00:50:27,400
I used to sell it, you know.
我还卖过煎粉呢

660
00:50:28,160 --> 00:50:29,360
You sold fried starch jelly?
妳卖煎粉？

661
00:50:30,240 --> 00:50:31,320
You don't believe me?
妳不信啊？

662
00:50:31,880 --> 00:50:33,640
It's how my mom made her living.
我妈之前就是卖煎粉的

663
00:50:33,720 --> 00:50:35,280
A two-square-meter cart,
一个两平方公尺的车

664
00:50:35,800 --> 00:50:36,720
one pan,
一口锅

665
00:50:36,800 --> 00:50:38,120
one gas cylinder,
一个煤气罐

666
00:50:38,200 --> 00:50:40,080
and my mom standing inside, frying.
我妈就站在里面炒

667
00:50:40,560 --> 00:50:43,000
Every day after school, I'd help her fry too.
我每天放学之后，我也帮我妈炒

668
00:50:43,600 --> 00:50:47,280
She scrimped on everything to keep me in school.
她省吃俭用就是为了供我念书

669
00:50:48,600 --> 00:50:50,560
Even the gas she bought was the cheapest kind —
连煤气罐都买最便宜的

670
00:50:50,640 --> 00:50:51,720
refilled on the sly.
私人灌的

671
00:50:53,440 --> 00:50:54,720
Then one day after school,
有一天放学

672
00:50:56,080 --> 00:50:57,200
she wasn't there.
我没看见她

673
00:50:58,720 --> 00:51:00,560
By the time I made it to the hospital,
我后来跑到医院的时候

674
00:51:02,760 --> 00:51:05,320
there wasn't an inch of skin on her that wasn't burned.
她浑身上下没有一块皮是好的

675
00:51:07,720 --> 00:51:09,920
The fucking gas cylinder had exploded.
他妈的，煤气罐子爆炸了

676
00:51:18,800 --> 00:51:21,680
How is your mom now?
那妳妈现在怎么样了？

677
00:51:26,200 --> 00:51:27,520
She drank pesticide and died.
喝农药死了

678
00:51:28,520 --> 00:51:30,160
The hospital fees were too high. There was no money for treatment.
住院费太高了，没钱治

679
00:51:39,520 --> 00:51:40,520
I'm sorry.
对不起啊

680
00:51:40,600 --> 00:51:41,560
Look at you.
看妳

681
00:51:41,640 --> 00:51:44,320
It's got nothing to do with you. What's there to be sorry for?
跟妳又没关系 有什么可对不起的呀？

682
00:51:48,600 --> 00:51:49,720
Not as good as my mom's.
没我妈做得好吃

683
00:51:53,840 --> 00:51:55,080
Ever since then,
从那以后

684
00:51:55,720 --> 00:51:57,520
I've kept reminding myself:
我就一直提醒我自己

685
00:51:59,600 --> 00:52:01,000
don't end up like my mom,
不能像我妈那样

686
00:52:04,000 --> 00:52:05,480
hounded to death for want of money.
被没钱逼死

687
00:52:15,640 --> 00:52:17,160
Why am I even telling you all this?
我跟妳說这些干嘛？

688
00:52:17,880 --> 00:52:18,920
Drink.
喝

689
00:52:32,320 --> 00:52:34,520
You know what I felt, the first time I saw you?
妳知道我第一次見妳什么感觉吗？

690
00:52:37,440 --> 00:52:38,640
What?
什么感觉？

691
00:52:40,600 --> 00:52:42,120
I remember thinking:
我当时就在想

692
00:52:44,400 --> 00:52:47,560
sooner or later, I'm going to become you.
早晚有一天我都要变成妳

693
00:52:49,280 --> 00:52:50,760
Pretty clothes to wear,
有好看的衣服穿

694
00:52:51,880 --> 00:52:53,320
and someone who loves me.
还有人喜欢

695
00:53:00,880 --> 00:53:03,360
Once you actually become me, you won't think that anymore.
等妳真的变成我就不这么想了

696
00:53:11,840 --> 00:53:14,120
You can still tell your story to people.
妳的故事还能跟别人说

697
00:53:18,000 --> 00:53:19,120
I can't.
我不行

698
00:53:30,440 --> 00:53:31,440
Shen Mo.
沈墨

699
00:53:32,440 --> 00:53:34,000
Do we count as friends?
咱俩算是朋友吗？

700
00:53:35,720 --> 00:53:36,920
Of course we do.
当然算

701
00:53:39,600 --> 00:53:41,680
Then whenever you feel like telling it,
那等妳之后什么时候想说了

702
00:53:42,560 --> 00:53:43,720
tell me.
就跟我说

703
00:53:50,160 --> 00:53:51,160
Okay.
好

704
00:53:58,160 --> 00:53:59,360
I'll go with you.
我陪妳去

705
00:54:10,600 --> 00:54:16,800
(Yuanyuan Home-Style Restaurant)
（源媛家常菜馆）

706
00:54:16,880 --> 00:54:22,640
(Yuanyuan Home-Style Restaurant)
（源媛家常菜馆）

707
00:54:22,720 --> 00:54:28,920
(Yuanyuan Home-Style Restaurant)
（源媛家常菜馆）

708
00:55:27,040 --> 00:55:29,360
It's late. I need to get back to the dorm.
太晚了，我要回宿舍了

709
00:55:30,400 --> 00:55:31,800
Finish this glass first.
喝完这杯吧

710
00:55:31,880 --> 00:55:33,480
I'll walk you back.
我陪妳走回去

711
00:55:37,800 --> 00:55:38,720
To friends.
为了朋友

712
00:55:44,200 --> 00:55:45,400
To friends.
为了朋友

